From 841c66186c1daf0783b01f3ce2798d5e1f622bc4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 17:17:43 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(2d): expose Adaptive Trochoidal engagement, return,
 return feed and loop width

Closes #1588: promote 2D Adaptive (Trochoidal)'s fixed max engagement,
return mode between loops, return feed, and loop width to undoable
operation parameters, project DTO fields, MCP parameters, and
Trochoidal-only Passes/Feeds UI rows.

Fixes #1588

Co-Authored-By: Antigravity (len) <noreply@anthropic.com>
