diff --git a/docs/decisions/1588-adaptive-troch-params.md b/docs/decisions/1588-adaptive-troch-params.md
index af9d21f89..4d52d72db 100644
--- a/docs/decisions/1588-adaptive-troch-params.md
+++ b/docs/decisions/1588-adaptive-troch-params.md
@@ -20,4 +20,4 @@
 
 **PR #1782 review remediation.**
 - Merged upstream main and retained both the trochoidal parameter set and the corner-arc parameter set, including main's refusal of arc turns with the Trochoidal method. Dropping either parameter set or bypassing that refusal was rejected because saved projects and generation must keep both laws.
-- Captured the actual egui shell for Passes and Feeds with Trochoidal selected. Kept review pictures under `docs/pr-1782/`, outside the release-only pixel goldens. The before pane uses the original PR parent's rendering body; the after pane uses the merged shipping body. A temporary signature adapter lets the original rendering body read the current grouped method field without changing its widgets.
+- Captured the actual egui shell for Passes and Feeds with Trochoidal selected. Stored review pictures only on the fork's images-only `pr-screenshots` branch and linked them from the PR body. Keeping screenshots or capture provenance on the PR branch was rejected because review evidence must stay outside the product branch. The before pane uses the original PR parent's rendering body; the after pane uses the merged shipping body. A temporary signature adapter lets the original rendering body read the current grouped method field without changing its widgets.
diff --git a/docs/pr-1782/README.md b/docs/pr-1782/README.md
deleted file mode 100644
index 24d41be63..000000000
--- a/docs/pr-1782/README.md
+++ /dev/null
@@ -1,24 +0,0 @@
-# PR #1782 review pictures
-
-These are captures of the actual egui shell and operation forms, with an actual
-`Adaptive1` operation using Method = Trochoidal. The Passes captures select
-Return = Microlift, height 0.4 mm. The Feeds captures show the same operation.
-
-- `before/`: the `roughing2d_pane` rendering body from the original PR parent,
-  `b0b443b211570ee54a10d753063a9698ff5b36aa`, in the merged shell. A temporary
-  signature adapter extracts Method from the new grouped parameter argument;
-  the old body and its widgets are otherwise unchanged.
-- `after/`: the merged shipping pane, retaining main's Arc turns control and
-  the PR's Trochoidal controls.
-
-The native GPU capture failed with `No adapter found` in this environment.
-A temporary CPU renderer rasterized the actual egui tessellated meshes and
-font atlas instead. It omitted bitmap toolbar icons and the viewport texture;
-all form controls and text come from the shipping egui code. The viewport in
-this test harness is a placeholder. These are review evidence, not pixel
-comparison goldens, and no release snapshot PNG was changed.
-
-The temporary capture test, renderer and original-body adapter were removed
-after rendering. The structural UI pin remains in
-`crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/adaptive_method.rs` and checks that Microlift
-height appears only for explicit Microlift, alongside the Passes/Feeds fields.
